# Include any files or directories that you don't want to be copied to your
# container here (e.g., local build artifacts, temporary files, etc.).
#
# For more help, visit the .dockerignore file reference guide at
# https://docs.docker.com/go/build-context-dockerignore/

# Git files
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# IDE and editor files
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/~

# Build artifacts
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/.cache
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output

# Logs
**/npm-debug.log
**/yarn-debug.log
**/yarn-error.log
**/*.log

# Test files
**/test
**/__tests__
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.js
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.js
**/jest.config.js
**/.eslintrc.js

# Docker files
**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
**/compose*

# CI/CD
**/.github
**/.gitlab-ci.yml
**/.travis.yml
**/azure-pipelines.yml

# Documentation
**/README.md
**/LICENSE
**/CHANGELOG.md
**/*.md

# Other
**/charts
**/*.*proj.user
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm
**/obj
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
